    <tok fileIndex="0" linenr="439" column="2" str="/** xx * @note Init descriptor table xx * Each circular buffer has room for &apos;$buf_count&quot; messages composed of 34 (32 data + miw + time) words (16b) in each.xx * The buffers must separated by 34 words. Due to the 128 kB limit on the addressable memory and if we split the space evenly,xx * buf_count will be limited to 14.xx * If ignore_mode_data is set then the space will only be distributed for the rx and tx subaddress increasing max buf count to 28xx * For safety reasons mode code addresses will still have a buffer of one message.xx * Each message has 34 words, thus the buffer memory of each descriptor will be separated by &amp;buf_count*34xx */"/>
