    <tok fileIndex="0" linenr="2375" column="1" str="/** x * @brief Appends incomming data to a milstd command belonging to a bc command list.x *x * @param [in] minor bc minor device number whose data belongs to.x * @param [in] data input data bufferx * @param [in] hdr Mil-std header comprising a RT address and a subaddressx * @param [in] size data buffer length in bytesx *x * @return air_status_code_e; status of the operation:x *  x- RTEMS_SUCESSFULL: Data was sucessfully written to the listx * xx- RTEMS_NOT_DEFINED: this data is not linked to any command in the listx *x * This function inserts incoming user data in the bc command list. For thatx * purpose it uses a shortcut mapping that matches every command in the listx * with a milstd header.  The header in the incoming data is used as a keyx * to that mapping, which yields the data transfer command affecting that header. x * This header is composed by one RT address and one subaddress.x *x */"/>
